Place your integration tests in this folder by creating files with the `*.integ.ts` extension. These files will be automatically detected by Playwright. For a real-world example, you can check out the Next.js Boilerplate Pro at https://nextjs-boilerplate.com/pro-saas-starter-kit

Or, need a Self-hosted auth stack (Better Auth)? Try Next.js Boilerplate Plus: https://nextjs-boilerplate.com/nextjs-saas-starter-kit
